---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base title="About" description="About Andrew Bishop, a software engineer on the west coast of Canada.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Greetings!</p>
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer from the west coast of Canada. I currently work as a Tech Lead at
      <a href="https://www.treez.io/">Treez</a>, a retail platform that dispensaries use for point of
      sale, payments, ecommerce and loyalty. My present focus is on scaling our product catalog,
      collection and discount systems to keep them fast and reliable.
    </p>
    <p>
      I occasionally write <a href="/blog">blog posts</a> about things I'm working on or learning
      about. I also like to tinker on small side projects to try out new technologies. Check out the
      <a href="/projects">projects</a> page, or find all the source code on
      <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
